                                        "entry_id": "4e7b1f74-1ff0-34be-bb78-0d10b0f4ec37",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Separation (disintegration) of a union; lack of union where union would be desirable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b4feda02-32c4-4df2-be2d-17d4c2884c90",
                                                "sense_id": "b4e1d553-4f7d-3184-806d-7da6484aa126",
                                                "text": "Hunger, cold, and mortification, the disunion of families; the separation of those the most fondly attached; youth bowed by premature toil; age wasting the little strength yet remaining:—these are the familiar objects which surround poverty."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
